Akos Varga <hamster@lord.banki.hu> wrote:
>Hi!
>
>I'm having some troubles with an old uVAXII. It was
>up and running, then we've ahd to shut it down. We've
>cleared the qbus cards, and when we've turned the
>thing on, it would not boot. The LED lights on the
>backside (that used to count down from 7 to 0) show
