  C is the diagnostic for "searching for RAM memory required for CPU ROM
programs", assuming you have a KA630 CPU (which you do if it's a MVII; MVIIIs
have KA650 (or is it KA655?), etc.)  Check the CPU board, the memory board(s),
and the cabling between the CPU and memory.

