>M7555
an RQDX3, MFM controller. This should be connected to a distribution panel.

>M7546
iirc, a TK50 controller. 
>M9047
This should be a very plain board with only a few traces. 
Its a grant continuity card, for keeping the bus 'continuous' 
thrgough a half-height slot when you dont have anythign that fits there.
Otherwise the bus gets terminated there. 
>M7606
the processor. This shoudl be connected to a memory board via a 50-pin ribbon 
cable.
>M3104
a DHV-11, 4-line async controller. 

Looks like a pretty standard system. I dont notice any memory here though!

