Don't know about the 100BaseT adapters, but did you know that your 500S's
can be converted to workstations by the simple addition of monitor, keyboard
and mouse (and oddball cables)?  I did this to mine for the cost of cables,
since I had spares of everything else.  I just thought that someone in the
Computer Graphics Lab at Cal Tech ought to be using the graphics subsystem
embedded in those decapitated workstations.  What a waste, otherwise.

