This is just a follow-up to an earlier post of mine.

I used to use a Intel/NT box for my desktop, and now I use an Alpha/NT
box (DPWS 433au). When I initially moved over, I bought a driver for
my Wacom graphics table (which I used to mitigate repetative motion
problems).

