> on the LSI-11/73 and plug the Falcon into a DLVJ port because RT-11
> won't load over a DZV and we don't have an RSX Falcon loader.
> 
> It's not pretty, but it works, requires almost no maintenance, and we
> have lots of spare parts.  The Falcon only has to be reloaded after
> power failures, and RSX and the instrument software work.  We could
> switch to a PC, but that would require upgrading all of the control
