	I've been pretty successful at coaxing VMS systems out of
most RWAST states.  Tape drives can typically be convinced by sending
an IO$_PACKACK to the drive (requires PHY_IO and SHARE privs).  Other
RWAST's may require other actions.

	See ftp://ftp.montagar.com/sessions/rwast.ps for a
copy of the presentation I've done for DECUS on getting systems
out of RWAST.  Can't get them all, but it does provide some helpful
information.

